\n5. **HKLM Run Registry**: No entries containing \"openclaw gateway node\"\n\n### Conclusion\n\nThe 5-10 second gateway restart loop **is NOT caused by**:\n- Scheduled tasks with \"openclaw gateway node\" in the name\n- Batch/cmd files in user or system startup folders\n- Registry \"Run\" entries (current user or local machine) containing \"openclaw gateway node\"\n\nThe offensive item causing the loop must be located elsewhere or identified by a different name/pattern. Further investigation is needed in other startup mechanisms or with different search terms."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":8930,"output":849,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9779,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771421526955}}
